{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1525190-need-suggestions-for-interlocks","id":1525190,"title":"Need suggestions for Interlocks","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-11-07T20:27:32-08:00","id":1525190,"title":"Need suggestions for Interlocks","content":"Hi folks!<br /> I'm setting up a campaign for Demon, and the hardest part always seems to be making Interlocks.<br /> For this one character, she's a Psychopomp who runs a black market HRT lab under their coffee shop, helping out trans people in red states and aiming to help people obtain the form they want.<br /> So far for her Keys I have Special Message as her first Embed. Her first Key is Tag And Release, which combines to make Message Received (The Demon knows when her special message has been read. Pretty self explanatory).<br /> Her second Key is Identity Theft. Combined with Tag and Release it makes the Interlock &quot;Freaky Friday&quot;. Instead of the victim of identity theft going into a slumber, they instead can gain the identity of the Demon if she wills it.<br /> From there I'm kinda stuck. Any suggestions?<br /> <br /> <br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25927-lolotovcocktail","name":"LolotovCocktail","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-08T13:06:03-08:00","id":1525217,"title":"","content":"The number of options can be overwhelming, especially with the creativity demanded by the Interlocks. So far, your Embeds of choice are:<br /> <br /> Special Message (Vocal)<br /> Tag and Release (Instrumental)<br /> Identity Theft (Mundane)<br /> <br /> Which means you covered all categories other than Cacophony, so I will limit myself to those to simplify matters. Right now, your Key and Interlock allow you to either steal an identity or to switch identities. You can complete that set by creating an Interlock that forces your identity upon others. Maybe physically, creating a body double - useful when your asset is meant to give you an alibi, or when you want to redirect enemies to a patsy. Maybe mentally, confusing the target into thinking they're your current Cover.<br /> <br /> Creating a delusion power may require one of the following as a Key:<br /> <br /> Anarchism<br /> Breakdown<br /> Devil's Advocate<br /> <br /> Creating a body transformation power may require one of these:<br /> <br /> Fractal Reality<br /> Left or Right?<br /> Special Someone","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-10T13:45:37-08:00","id":1525324,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Teatime</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1525190-need-suggestions-for-interlocks?p=1525217#post1525217\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The number of options can be overwhelming, especially with the creativity demanded by the Interlocks. So far, your Embeds of choice are:<br /> <br /> Special Message (Vocal)<br /> Tag and Release (Instrumental)<br /> Identity Theft (Mundane)<br /> <br /> Which means you covered all categories other than Cacophony, so I will limit myself to those to simplify matters. Right now, your Key and Interlock allow you to either steal an identity or to switch identities. You can complete that set by creating an Interlock that forces your identity upon others. Maybe physically, creating a body double - useful when your asset is meant to give you an alibi, or when you want to redirect enemies to a patsy. Maybe mentally, confusing the target into thinking they're your current Cover.<br /> <br /> Creating a delusion power may require one of the following as a Key:<br /> <br /> Anarchism<br /> Breakdown<br /> Devil's Advocate<br /> <br /> Creating a body transformation power may require one of these:<br /> <br /> Fractal Reality<br /> Left or Right?<br /> Special Someone</div> </div> </div> </div>Ooh, I like Special Someone as the next key. Combined, I'll make Heuristic Realization Trance, where the Unchained unlocks the target's ideal self, and allows their body to make incremental changes towards it while they meditate<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25927-lolotovcocktail","name":"LolotovCocktail","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-11T04:15:31-08:00","id":1525343,"title":"","content":"I'm happy to have nudged you towards an idea you like.<br /> <br /> Obviously, your Demon will use that as treatment for trans folks, but consider what other functions the Interlock may have. Does it gradually regrow lost limbs? Remove or add tattoos? Can it make you more or less attractive, make you look younger or older? What defines a target's &quot;ideal self&quot;? If it's self-image, what happens if the target has an unhealthy, or an unusual one? If it's a Destiny that grants the target greatest peace with themselves, what if it has to cripple the target, or make them unrecognizable to their family?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}